{"id":"svernut_","lemma":"свернуть","pos":"verb","rank":4721,"glosses":["to displace, to remove","to roll up","to curtail, to reduce, to cut down"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"сверну","2s":"свернёшь","3s":"свернёт","1p":"свернём","2p":"свернёте","3p":"свернут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"сверни","2p":"сверните"}}},"past":{"m":"свернул","p":"свернули","f":"свернула","n":"свернуло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"свёртывать","examples":[{"text":"Я свернул окно.","en":"I minimized the window.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"window"}]},{"text":"Мы не туда свернули.","en":"We took a wrong turn.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"На углу он свернул налево.","en":"He turned to the left at the corner.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to the left"}]},{"text":"Вера может свернуть горы.","en":"Faith can move mountains.","words":[{"g":"belief, faith"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"mountain","l":"гора"}]},{"text":"Я думаю, мы где-то не там свернули.","en":"I think we made a wrong turn somewhere.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},null]}]}